MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR TUI_OS (VAULT WORLDWIDE):
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.

This is one continuous personal OS field — not a dashboard, not stacked sections.
No cards, rounded corners, soft shadows, section billboards, DateBlocks, or teal watermarks.

PALETTE: Field #000000 · Paper #F4F4F0 · Cobalt #0000FF.
Cobalt = underlines + note overlay. Paper = month digits.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial. Small month digits. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk. No globe seal.

COMPOSITION (mobile-first):
1. Current month as digits 1…last. 7 equal columns, day 1 top-left, no weekday offset. Off-white Helvetica on black. No header.
2. Tap a day → one-line floating dock is the note REPL for that day.
3. A day with notes gets a cobalt hairline under the digit.
4. Tap a day with notes → notes drop from that line (cobalt fill, white text), overlaying the field. Tap the digit, another day, or empty field to dismiss.
5. ONE one-line dock, locked to viewport bottom. Never three forms.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks, jagged day cards, SaaS stacks, acid watermarks, giant boxed logos, demo fluff.
Do not revive the globe seal, beige cassette chrome, todo nest, or scratch dump.
